  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MINUSTAH. UNITED NATIONS STABILIZATION MISSION IN HAITI.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MINUSTAH worked to fulfil its original mandate to restore a secure and stable environment, to promote the political process, to strengthen Haiti&#x2019;s Government institutions and rule-of-law-structures, as well as to promote and to protect human rights.

The mission closed on 15 October 2017, transitioning to a smaller follow-up peacekeeping Mission, MINUJUSTH,  which would support Government efforts to strengthen rule-of-law institutions, further develop the Haitian National Police and engage in human rights monitoring, reporting and analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
